{"ID":"20240515143614-9smsksz","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240515143614-9smsksz","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515143614-9smsksz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515143850-umx26ig\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515143850-umx26ig\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:400,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515143850-umx26ig\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:605,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:605\u0026#125;","title":"112","type":"doc","updated":"20240515185105"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240515143850-umx26ig","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 906px;","id":"20240515143850-umx26ig","updated":"20240515185105"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：2008/08/12"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"ZZ"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"35歲，很瘦"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/08/12"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"自認有憂鬱證，近來覺身發熱，時發頭痛，自覺從。足心冷到膝蓋，左肩胛骨痛、左膏肓痛、後背痛(延足太陽上下痛，含帶脈)、左脅下痛、右腰後悶痛、月經後左下腹抽痛、自覺吸氣淺，只能到中脘附近，白帶嚴重、經痛、經常呃氣、胃酸反逆、臉上有乾蘚。大便不成形。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（1）寒熱：近來身覺發熱，時又頭痛。自覺從足心冷至膝。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）胃口：好，時又過餓"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（3）大便：每日一次，黃褐。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（4）小便：黃"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（5）口渴：尚好。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（6）睡眠：時好時壞。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（7）月經：白帶多，經來腹痛。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（8）其他：時噯氣(胃酸)、臉頰有乾蘚，退皮且癢"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"無"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡黃紅"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、眼診 :"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"無"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"耳診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"無"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"真寒假熱"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"針灸處方："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中藥處方： "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生附子二錢(布包)、乾薑二錢、炙甘草五錢"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"麻黃二錢、杏仁三錢、薏苡仁三錢、當歸二錢、白芍五錢、鬱金五錢、"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黃芩二錢、遠志五錢、龍骨三錢、牡蠣五錢"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桂枝四錢、茯神三錢"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"二付，"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"每付九碗煮成三碗，"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早晚飯前。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說：\n1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因此人易緊張，師開牡蠣五錢鎮驚，因病人吃素，去牡蠣改茯神。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"真寒假熱單用生附去裏寒即可，上熱下寒則要同時開去上熱及去下寒的藥。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"此女足冷至膝是裏寒，故用四逆湯。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"4"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因裏寒盛，吸氣無法下降至丹田。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"5"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"自覺憂鬱且來診時易緊張，師用當歸、鬱金、黃芩、遠志、茯神等情志藥"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"6"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"舌苔鮮黃，表示病淺，癌症病人舌苔黯或鏡面舌，難治。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"7"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"麻杏薏甘湯治皮蘚，能除皮下之濕。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]}]}]}